<view class="page"><view class="title">鸟种设置</view><view class="tip">关注鸟种会在推荐中优先突出；不关注鸟种会在地点明细中隐藏。</view><view class="label">关注鸟种（逗号分隔）</view><textarea value="{{interested}}" bindinput="setInterested" placeholder="例如：鸮,一级保护动物"/><view class="label">不关注鸟种（逗号分隔）</view><textarea value="{{uninterested}}" bindinput="setUninterested"/><button class="save" bindtap="save">保存鸟种设置</button></view>
